GIVEN `it is the contents of an application under subsection 672.501(3)` IS A BOOLEAN   -- (a)
      `it is evidence taken, information given or submissions made at a hearing under subsection 672.501(7)` IS A BOOLEAN   -- (b)
      `it is other information that could identify the person to whom the application relates as a victim or witness in the proceedings` IS A BOOLEAN   -- (c)
      `the Review Board refuses to make an order under subsection 672.501(3)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 672.501(10) the section bars publication of the application, the hearing or identifying information` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the Review Board refuses to make an order under subsection 672.501(3)` THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Unless the Review Board refuses to make an order under subsection (3)"
        IF `it is the contents of an application under subsection 672.501(3)` OR `it is evidence taken, information given or submissions made at a hearing under subsection 672.501(7)` OR `it is other information that could identify the person to whom the application relates as a victim or witness in the proceedings` THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): "no person shall publish in any document or broadcast or transmit in any way"

-- 672.501(11): every person who fails to comply with an order made under any of subsections (1) to (3) is guilty of an offence punishable on summary conviction. The penalty itself is in Part XXVII, outside this part.
-- src:13673 | (11) Every person who fails to comply with an order made under any of subsections (1) to (3) is guilty of an offence punishable on summary conviction.
@ref s 672.501(11) (src:13673)
