GIVETH A MAYBE Punishment
`s 672.501(11) the punishment of the person who fails to comply with the order` MEANS
    IF `the person fails to comply with an order made under any of subsections 672.501(1) to (3)`
    THEN JUST (Punishment OF `on summary conviction`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Every person who fails to comply with an order made under any of subsections (1) to (3)"

-- 672.501(12): for greater certainty, an order referred to in subsection (11) also prohibits, in relation to proceedings taken against any person who fails to comply with the order, the publication in any document or the broadcasting or transmission in any way of information
-- that could identify a victim or witness whose identity is protected by the order.
